{"3891900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FLINT", "steam_appid": 3891900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The world is full of dangers, from the wilderness to other players who are ready to take everything you've created by force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Crafting and battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create weapons, armor, traps, and totems. Use any means necessary to survive battles alone or with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tribes and territories</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form tribes, build fortresses, and conquer land. Leave your totem and protect it with blood and steel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living open world</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living, harsh, and changing world. From sunny beaches and dense forests to rocky ranges, flooded valleys, and swamps, each location hides resources, secrets, and new threats. Day turns to night, weather affects creature behavior, and each biome requires a different approach to survival. There are no signs here. Only instincts, a map that you'll draw yourself, and paths that you'll create first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The world is full of dangers, from the wilderness to other players who are ready to take everything you've created by force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Crafting and battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create weapons, armor, traps, and totems. Use any means necessary to survive battles alone or with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tribes and territories</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form tribes, build fortresses, and conquer land. Leave your totem and protect it with blood and steel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living open world</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living, harsh, and changing world. From sunny beaches and dense forests to rocky ranges, flooded valleys, and swamps, each location hides resources, secrets, and new threats. Day turns to night, weather affects creature behavior, and each biome requires a different approach to survival. There are no signs here. Only instincts, a map that you'll draw yourself, and paths that you'll create first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Multiplayer survival in an open world. Build your base, farm, hunt different creatures, survive in a harsh world, fight or team up with other players and evolve through the ages.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891900/9f48eaacb4c21b5d22b988a91454bfd36a404a31/header.jpg?t=1775057723", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891900/5047cae00b936c3c5906e2d6d29059281b634103/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775057723", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891900/5047cae00b936c3c5906e2d6d29059281b634103/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775057723", "website": "https://t.me/flintsurvival", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6400 / AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pr